                                "example_id": "1bc6e8a4-9c99-47d1-b0fd-c0a90b023570",
                                "sense_id": "9a4a8a32-c1f9-3f18-9a40-d3c8a0249d46",
                                "text": "He had a down year at the plate, hitting just .251 with 14 homers, but was nearly flawless in the field as he posted that record .996 fielding percentage, a 95-game errorless streak, and just three errors all season."
                            }
                        ]
